<title>USA: Illinois Health Facilities Auth $27 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Illinois Health Facilities Auth $27 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it tentatively priced $27 million of Illinois Health Facilities Authority revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996B, for Sarah Bush Lincoln Health Center, with a top yield of 6.20 percent in 2022.  </p>
