<p>RE: $27,200,000*</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, SERIES 1996B</p>
<p>(SARAH BUSH LINCOLN HEALTH CENTER)</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: A-</p>
